[{"category":"section","location":"literate/examples/#Examples","page":"Examples","text":"import Pasteee\n\nTo access the Paste.ee API, you need an Application Key. You can create yours at the following link: https://paste.ee/account/api (after logging in to Paste.ee) In that page, first create an Application, then click ACTIONS -> AUTHORIZATION PAGE, and then SUBMIT. You will see the Application Key.\n\nconst appkey = ENV[\"PASTEEE_APPKEY\"]; nothing #hide\n\nIn the following examples I assume that you have assigned your Application Key to the appkey variable.\n\nCreate a paste that expires in one hour.\n\nid = Pasteee.paste(appkey, \"Hola mundo\"; expiration=\"3600\")\n\nThe paste can be retrieved using the returned id.\n\npaste = Pasteee.get(appkey, id)\n\nPaste.ee pastes are organized in sections. Here we retrieve the contents of section number 1 of the paste we just created.\n\npaste[\"sections\"][1][\"contents\"]\n\nDelete the paste.\n\nPasteee.delete(appkey, id)\n\n\n\nThis page was generated using Literate.jl.","title":"Examples"},{"category":"section","location":"reference/#Reference","page":"Reference","text":"","title":"Reference"},{"category":"type","location":"reference/#Pasteee.Section","page":"Reference","text":"Section(contents; name = \"\", syntax = \"\")\n\nCreates a paste Section with contents. The syntax argument determines syntax highlight.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.Section"},{"category":"method","location":"reference/#Pasteee.delete-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Reference","text":"delete(appkey, id)\n\nDeletes paste id from Paste.ee.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.delete"},{"category":"method","location":"reference/#Pasteee.get-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Reference","text":"get(appkey, id)\n\nFetch paste id from Paste.ee.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.get"},{"category":"method","location":"reference/#Pasteee.paste-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractVector{Pasteee.Section}}","page":"Reference","text":"paste(appkey, sections; description = \"\", expiration = \"never\")\n\nSubmit a paste to Paste.ee and return its id. The sections argument is either a Vector of Section objects, or a single Section object.\n\nThe expiration setting can be set to \"never\" (default), or to a number of seconds given as a String (e.g., \"3600\" for one hour).\n\nSee https://pastee.github.io/docs/.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.paste"},{"category":"method","location":"reference/#Pasteee.paste-Tuple{AbstractString, String}","page":"Reference","text":"paste(appkey, contents::String; name = \"\", syntax = \"\", ...)\n\nPaste a single section with contents, name and syntax given.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.paste"},{"category":"method","location":"reference/#Pasteee.pastes-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Reference","text":"pastes(appkey; perpage = 25, page = 1)\n\nRetrieve all pastes, organized in pages containing perpage entries. Returns entries in page number page.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Pasteee.pastes"},{"category":"section","location":"#Pasteee.jl-Documentation","page":"Home","text":"A Julia wrapper around the Paste.ee API.\n\nSee https://pastee.github.io/docs/.","title":"Pasteee.jl Documentation"},{"category":"section","location":"#Installation","page":"Home","text":"This package is registered. Install with:\n\nimport Pkg\nPkg.add(\"Pasteee\")\n\nThe source code is hosted on Github: https://github.com/cossio/Pasteee.jl","title":"Installation"},{"category":"section","location":"#Usage","page":"Home","text":"This package doesn't export any symbols. There are three main functions:\n\nPasteee.paste to create a paste\nPasteee.get to retrieve a paste\nPasteee.delete to delete a paste\n\nSee the Examples for usage help. See also the Reference section.","title":"Usage"}]
